  "EventItemTitle": "A regular meeting of the City Council of the City of Boston was held in the Christopher A. Iannella Chamber, City Hall on Wednesday, September 30, 2026 at 12:07 P.M.\r\n\r\nPresident Breadon in the Chair. Present Councilors Coletta Zapata, Culpepper, Durkan, FitzGerald, Flynn, Louijeune, Mejia, Murphy, Pep\u00e9n, Santana, Weber, and Worrell.\r\n\r\nFather Paolo Cumin, Sacred Heart Parish, delivered the invocation, and the meeting was opened with the Pledge of Allegiance.\r\n\r\nThe Chair moved to adopt the minutes from the September 23, 2026 City Council Meeting.\r\n\r\nMotion prevailed.",
